---
title: "9 · Opportunity files"
description: Where the drafts, signed copies and other files of a deal are kept, and how a file is deleted.
sidebar:
  order: 16
  label: "9 · Opportunity files"
---

**Who:** anyone who can see the opportunity can see its files. Uploading and deleting need edit rights on the opportunity.

Each opportunity is treated as a case with its own folder. The drafts (PDF and Word), the edited drafts, the signed copies and every file uploaded on the **Files** tab with **Upload file** are kept there. Select a file's name to preview it, or select **Download**.

{% screenshot id="crm/files-tab" caption="The Files tab of an opportunity." /%}

While the folder holds files, the same folder is also shown in the document library under **Cases**, next to the folders of task cases.

{% screenshot id="crm/files-library-cases" caption="The same folder under Cases in the document library." /%}

## Delete a file

{% steps %}

1. On the file's row, select **Delete file**.
2. Check the file name in the dialog and select **Delete file** again.

{% /steps %}

The file is removed from the opportunity's files; this cannot be undone here.

{% screenshot id="crm/files-delete" caption="Deleting a file uploaded by mistake." /%}

{% aside type="note" title="Contract files cannot be deleted here" %}
The drafts and signed copies of the opportunity's contracts are locked: they carry an ⓘ instead of **Delete file**. Change them from the **Contract** tab. A file that has moved to the company's files is managed there.
{% /aside %}
